@SampleApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Create an order
POST {{SampleApi_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Order #1",
  "quantity": 3
}

###

### List all active orders (soft-deleted are excluded)
GET {{SampleApi_HostAddress}}/orders
Accept: application/json

###

### Soft-delete an order by id
DELETE {{SampleApi_HostAddress}}/orders/1

###
